[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3514720277","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112574#issuecomment-3514720277","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112574","id":3514720277,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RfmAV","user":{"login":"MiracleAig","id":103385042,"node_id":"U_kgDOBimH0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103385042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig","html_url":"https://github.com/MiracleAig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiracleAig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-11T02:30:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-11T02:30:19Z","body":"I tried the same thing on windows and something I noticed is that if  you try and drag images that synced to one drive in the cloud but are not on your device you will get an error importing that image. However, when I did this with an image that was on my device it worked without issue, so perhaps your problem is trying to import images that are not currently on your device. To fix it try starting OneDrive on your computer and see if that changes anything. \n\n<img width=\"222\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a98ee17-f39c-4262-a0b7-bbeb75fb07a7\" />\n\nImages that are synced to the cloud but are not on your device look like this (on the right) while images on your device look like this (on the left). However, if this wasn't your issue I wasn't able to reproduce the problem to your specifications. If you could upload a video of you trying to reproduce the issue would help.\n\n<img width=\"273\" height=\"316\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fccee09-def8-4501-8e6a-e79180eae915\" />\n\nThe files with an X are the ones that were synced to OneDrive but not on my machiene.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3514720277/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3535901539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112574#issuecomment-3535901539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112574","id":3535901539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SwZNj","user":{"login":"New1ine","id":189438435,"node_id":"U_kgDOC0qZ4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189438435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine","html_url":"https://github.com/New1ine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/New1ine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_a